<mxCell id="t265" value="&lt;font style='font-size:13px' color='#595959'&gt;&amp;#128274; Explicit only: Codex never starts, redoes or stops work on its own&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="1185" width="860" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b267" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:17px'&gt;How the plugin reaches the harness&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Each skill is a &lt;font face='Courier New'&gt;SKILL.md&lt;/font&gt; that tells Codex which harness tool to call and what to show back; &lt;font face='Courier New'&gt;mcp.json&lt;/font&gt; registers the harness MCP server.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The run lives in Google Cloud. Workflows carries it from step to step; people only approve, send back or stop. Skills that start, redo or stop work set &lt;font face='Courier New'&gt;allow_implicit_invocation: false&lt;/font&gt;. The plugin holds no Jira, Salesforce or Copado credentials.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;QA skills read Zephyr Scale and Copado results as &lt;font face='Courier New'&gt;sa-ai-read&lt;/font&gt;. Only &lt;font face='Courier New'&gt;$harness-regression&lt;/font&gt; starts work, as &lt;font face='Courier New'&gt;sa-ai-release&lt;/font&gt;, after a QA lead approves." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1243" width="410" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b268" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:17px'&gt;Two Codex roles&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Front-door Codex:&lt;/b&gt; loads the plugin; people invoke skills and approve here.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Worker Codex:&lt;/b&gt; headless (Codex SDK / &lt;font face='Courier New'&gt;codex exec&lt;/font&gt;) inside the Developer and Test Agents; own branch, DEV sandbox only." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#E0FAFE;strokeColor=#0097AD;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1559" width="410" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b269" value="&lt;font color='#8C8C8C'&gt;● ● ●&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Codex session with the plugin, illustrative run&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#FFFFFF'&gt;&amp;gt; $harness-deliver NS-1234&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8C8C8C'&gt;[skill] harness-deliver → harness.start_run(NS-1234)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#00D6F2'&gt;[01] Reading NS-1234 · drafting acceptance criteria&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#FFD700'&gt;[H1] waiting: product owner approval (link)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#00D6F2'&gt;[02] Graph: exists? no · reuse: 1 flow&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#00D6F2'&gt;[02] Blast radius: automations on object, 2 pods&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#FF0069'&gt;[02] Guardian: NEEDS OWNER APPROVAL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#FFD700'&gt;[H2] waiting: architect + affected pod owner&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#00D6F2'&gt;[03] Branch harness/NS-1234 · deploy to DEV&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#00D6F2'&gt;[03] Apex tests passing · pull request opened&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#00D6F2'&gt;[04] Review: 0 blocking · regression: 2 pods&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#FFD700'&gt;[H3] waiting: tech lead + security&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#00D6F2'&gt;[05] Copado: promoted to SIT, then UAT&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#FFD700'&gt;[H4] waiting: business UAT sign-off&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#00D6F2'&gt;[07] Release bundle, rollback plan, CAB pack&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#FFD700'&gt;[CAB] approved · owner pipeline deploys&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#00D6F2'&gt;[09] Done · Jira closed · graph refreshed&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8C8C8C'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#FFFFFF'&gt;&amp;gt; $harness-ask-graph who owns HealthcareFacility?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#B39DDB'&gt;[graph] 3 automations · 2 owning pods · cited&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8C8C8C'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8C8C8C'&gt;links: brief · design · PR · UAT · passport&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#0D1117;strokeColor=#0D1117;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="490" y="1243" width="470" height="451" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
